<title>BELGIUM: HEATED BELGIAN RENAULT WORKERS CLASH WITH POLICE.</title>
<headline>HEATED BELGIAN RENAULT WORKERS CLASH WITH POLICE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian police on Friday turned water cannon on irate Renault workers who were marching in their hundreds through central Brussels in protest at plans to shut down their Belgian car plant.</p>
<p>Protesters clashed with police as they threw eggs and stones and tried to break through a barricade in front of the offices of the Flemish regional government in Brussels.</p>
</text>
